  "ingredients": [
    "4 cups self-rising flour",
    "2 (8 ounce) containers yogurt",
    "2 eggs",
    "2 tablespoons white sugar",
    "2 tablespoons vanilla sugar",
    "1 pinch salt",
    "3 quarts vegetable oil for frying"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/c8JAu_MAJGiLmOuOd8SrL7-z1As=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11438-sufganiyot-VAT-step-01-903fe7bb9f784c27a8ede8dff94f793c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11438/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Combine flour, yogurt, eggs, sugar, vanilla sugar, and salt in a large bowl; mix well. Set the dough aside for 30 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WtgeIQlg3lrSNZHK6gJL6ryZkMA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11438-sufganiyot-VAT-step-02-35572d75765e467795db73e70d38df90.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11438/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Form dough into 2-inch balls.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/y0TVgT5lb5FqOrEeERXLlQsHMOE=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11438-sufganiyot-VAT-step-03-e48419470e3f4f69b6c4133ecd4348bf.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11438/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat vegetable oil in a large pot or deep fryer over medium-high heat to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Deep-fry sufganiyot, in batches, in hot oil until golden brown, about 3 minutes, flipping halfway through.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/34Kq619OsYPP_maZV05MLjhHEes=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11438-sufganiyot-VAT-step-04-b698370447244c20b017b217d2e838f6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11438/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer donuts to a paper towel-lined plate using a slotted spoon. Repeat with remaining dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8_uI7b9DRLz98wkCa4VpozxvSLc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-11438-sufganiyot-VAT-step-05-b2d52e7cdf324aa6a266a52bc3e8b791.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/11438/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Enjoy!",
